       (arbitraryCusp_image_restrict_le M a b ha)).map
         (measurable_integralOrbitProjection _)).trans hcompact.absolutelyContinuous⟩
   exact himage.comp (arbitraryCusp_smul_measurePreserving M a b).quasiMeasurePreserving

