    _=∫z in periodDomain,cubeAverage p hp cubicSourceResidualFunction (upperPoint z v hv)*
      ShortDraftTrace.breveE (-cuspFrequency h*z):=(cubeSource_fourier p hp h v hv).symm
    _=(Ideal.absNorm (Ideal.span {p}):ℂ)⁻¹*
