  intro r jStar hr hj take hkeep ξ tmarks umarks big b κ ht hb hκ g hg s Y P R hs hne
    hY hYlo hYhi hR hRY hsp qP qT χP χT τP τT lo hi F UM UT hUM hUT hMband hFband
