    Vs hVs aux v vmin vmax hρ0 hρ1 hv hvmin hVlo hVhi hμ hmass T ht π hπ hπmass
    (fun σ => σ) (fun s => productTotalMemory s.2 ≤ B) (fun _ => Φ) H hH (fun _ => hΦ)
