      (2*F*Real.sqrt ((⌈L^2⌉₊ : ℝ)/
        (((J+ell).choose ell)^(candidateSmallPIndices scale L).card : ℕ))*
        Real.sqrt (K^(candidateBigPIndices scale L).card)) ≤
